      "content": "it just feels like there's no real \"resting\" from it, you know? even when i'm home, it's like i'm still there. i look at my hands and all i see is the things i couldn't fix. it's like the only way to actually be done with all this weight is to just... stop existing in it. like, is it even wrong to want everything to just be quiet? to just let the machine stop for good?",
